    <!--
      Castle Game Engine DPROJ template note:
      Android and iOS are deliberately not listed as target platforms
      of this project, and we do not specify their libraries,
      deployment classes etc. here.

      These things are specific to the Delphi version, so let Delphi generate them:
      in Delphi IDE, right-click on "Target Platforms" and choose "Add Platform...".
      Here we only make sure that
      - the output of mobile platforms goes to a separate
        directory for each platform, not to the project directory,
      - application has default Delphi artwork (launcher icons, splash screens etc.),
        same as in a new project created by Delphi IDE.
    -->
